// Random bytes and the numbers drawn from them, over any entropy source the
// caller supplies. No platform code: the platform source is `moonrand/system`.
//   RFC 4086, Randomness Requirements for Security: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4086
//   FIPS 186-5 A.2.2, rejection sampling: https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/186-5/final
